{"parse": {"title": "Time Machine", "pageid": 167, "revid": 43855, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Overview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Overview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Tips\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tips</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 240px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/5f/TimeMachine.png/revision/latest?cb=20220705005649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"TimeMachine\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/5f/TimeMachine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/240?cb=20220705005649\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"240\" height=\"236\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"TimeMachine.png\" data-image-key=\"TimeMachine.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:TimeMachine.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Time Machine</b> is a landmark located in the Lobby. Entering it will teleport you out of the main experience to AFK for gems. AFKing will grant the normal Player +3 Gems every <b>150 seconds,</b> and players with VIP or Roblox Premium will be granted +6 Gems every 150 seconds. As of Update 19.5, the Time Machine is currently disabled.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>VIP and Roblox's Premium subscriptions <b>do</b> stack with each other.</li>\n<li><b>AFKing</b> in here is one of the best ways to gain lots of gems when you're away from your device. Using a macro software such as TinyTask to prevent disconnecting and perform infinite runs will let you gain more gems per session.</li>\n<li>Recommended to participate with caution as AFKing for a long time could lead to your PC/mobile device overheating and possibly shutting off.</li>\n<li>The only way to save your gems is to click \"leave and claim reward\". If you get kicked out while you're in the Time Machine, it will save your gems, but closing Roblox manually won't.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gems\">Gems</span></h2>\n<p><font size=\"4\"> <b>Every Hour</b> </font>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">72 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">72 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">144 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">144 Gems</span></span></a> (with Premium or <a href=\"/wiki/Store\" title=\"Store\">VIP gamepass</a>)</li></ul>\n<p><font size=\"4\"> <b>Every 8 hours</b> </font>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">576 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">576 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">1,152 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">1,152 Gems</span></span></a> (with Premium or <a href=\"/wiki/Store\" title=\"Store\">VIP gamepass</a>)</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">2304 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">2304 Gems</span></span></a>  (with Premium and <a href=\"/wiki/Store\" title=\"Store\">VIP gamepass</a>)</li></ul>\n<p><font size=\"4\"> <b>Every 24 hours</b> </font>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">1,728 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">1,728 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">3,456 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">3,456 Gems</span></span></a> (with Premium or <a href=\"/wiki/Store\" title=\"Store\">VIP gamepass</a>)</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">4608 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">4608 Gems</span></span></a> (with Premium and <a href=\"/wiki/Store\" title=\"Store\">VIP gamepass</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>From update 19.0, <b>Time Machine</b> was temporary disable.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022120554\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 156/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1702/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 124/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recur